Code statements included in point 1 should be as brief as possible, only include the ones that are most related to the root cause and  the number of code statements may not exceed 3.


Here is the commit message:
bug fixed that introduced at 800f8fb716694

Here is the root cause:
The bug was likely caused by the incorrect management of the parent-child relationship in the abstract syntax tree (AST) due to the use of the `SetChild` method on the parent node. This method may not have properly established the relationship or could have led to inconsistencies in the node structure, resulting in traversal or manipulation issues within the AST.

Here is the patch:

 	public ZNode(ZNode ParentNode, ZToken SourceToken, int Size) {
 		assert(this != ParentNode);
-		ParentNode.SetChild(this, ZNode._EnforcedParent);
+		this.ParentNode = ParentNode;
 		this.SourceToken = SourceToken;
 		if(Size > 0) {
 			this.AST = LibZen._NewNodeArray(Size);
 		}
 		else {
 			this.AST = null;
 		}
 	}



